[
  {
    "index": 0,
    "text": "Lesson 79.",
    "start": 1.51,
    "end": 4.022,
    "zh": "第79课。",
    "zh_hant": "第79課。"
  },
  {
    "index": 1,
    "text": "Carol's shopping list.",
    "start": 4.072,
    "end": 6.233,
    "zh": "卡萝尔的购物清单。",
    "zh_hant": "卡蘿爾的購物清單。"
  },
  {
    "index": 2,
    "text": "Listen to the tape then answer this question.",
    "start": 7.954,
    "end": 11.855,
    "zh": "听录音，然后回答这个问题。",
    "zh_hant": "聽錄音，然後回答這個問題。"
  },
  {
    "index": 3,
    "text": "What is Carol not going to buy?",
    "start": 14.057,
    "end": 17.398,
    "zh": "卡萝尔不打算买什么？",
    "zh_hant": "卡蘿爾不打算買什麼？"
  },
  {
    "index": 4,
    "text": "What are you doing, Carol?",
    "start": 19.8,
    "end": 21.6,
    "zh": "你在做什么，卡萝尔？",
    "zh_hant": "你在做什麼，卡蘿爾？"
  },
  {
    "index": 5,
    "text": "I'm making a shopping list, Tom.",
    "start": 22.181,
    "end": 24.482,
    "zh": "我在写购物清单，汤姆。",
    "zh_hant": "我在寫購物清單，湯姆。"
  },
  {
    "index": 6,
    "text": "What do we need?",
    "start": 25.382,
    "end": 26.843,
    "zh": "我们需要什么？",
    "zh_hant": "我們需要什麼？"
  },
  {
    "index": 7,
    "text": "We need a lot of things this week.",
    "start": 27.103,
    "end": 29.865,
    "zh": "这周我们需要很多东西。",
    "zh_hant": "這周我們需要很多東西。"
  },
  {
    "index": 8,
    "text": "I must go to the grocer's.",
    "start": 31.626,
    "end": 33.706,
    "zh": "我必须去杂货店。",
    "zh_hant": "我必須去雜貨店。"
  },
  {
    "index": 9,
    "text": "We haven't got much tea or coffee,",
    "start": 34.487,
    "end": 37.248,
    "zh": "我们的茶叶和咖啡不多了，",
    "zh_hant": "我們的茶葉和咖啡不多了，"
  },
  {
    "index": 10,
    "text": "and we haven't got any sugar or jam.",
    "start": 37.469,
    "end": 40.53,
    "zh": "而且我们没有任何糖或果酱了。",
    "zh_hant": "而且我們沒有任何糖或果醬了。"
  },
  {
    "index": 11,
    "text": "What about vegetables?",
    "start": 41.491,
    "end": 43.311,
    "zh": "蔬菜呢？",
    "zh_hant": "蔬菜呢？"
  },
  {
    "index": 12,
    "text": "I must go to the greengroce's.",
    "start": 44.612,
    "end": 47.113,
    "zh": "我必须去蔬菜水果店。",
    "zh_hant": "我必須去蔬菜水果店。"
  },
  {
    "index": 13,
    "text": "We haven't got many tomatoes,",
    "start": 47.474,
    "end": 50.215,
    "zh": "我们的西红柿不多了，",
    "zh_hant": "我們的西紅柿不多了，"
  },
  {
    "index": 14,
    "text": "but we've got a lot of potatoes.",
    "start": 50.536,
    "end": 52.937,
    "zh": "但土豆有很多。",
    "zh_hant": "但土豆有很多。"
  },
  {
    "index": 15,
    "text": "I must go to the butcher's, too.",
    "start": 54.158,
    "end": 56.799,
    "zh": "我还必须去肉店。",
    "zh_hant": "我還必須去肉店。"
  },
  {
    "index": 16,
    "text": "We need some meat.",
    "start": 57.059,
    "end": 58.6,
    "zh": "我们需要一些肉。",
    "zh_hant": "我們需要一些肉。"
  },
  {
    "index": 17,
    "text": "We haven't got any meat at all.",
    "start": 58.98,
    "end": 61.221,
    "zh": "我们一点肉都没有了。",
    "zh_hant": "我們一點肉都沒有了。"
  },
  {
    "index": 18,
    "text": "Have we got any beer and wine?",
    "start": 61.902,
    "end": 64.523,
    "zh": "我们有啤酒和葡萄酒吗？",
    "zh_hant": "我們有啤酒和葡萄酒嗎？"
  },
  {
    "index": 19,
    "text": "No, we haven't.",
    "start": 64.463,
    "end": 65.884,
    "zh": "不，没有。",
    "zh_hant": "不，沒有。"
  },
  {
    "index": 20,
    "text": "And I'm not going to get any!",
    "start": 65.624,
    "end": 67.625,
    "zh": "而且我也不打算去买！",
    "zh_hant": "而且我也不打算去買！"
  },
  {
    "index": 21,
    "text": "I hope that you've got some money.",
    "start": 68.886,
    "end": 71.087,
    "zh": "我希望你有一些钱。",
    "zh_hant": "我希望你有一些錢。"
  },
  {
    "index": 22,
    "text": "I haven't got much.",
    "start": 71.647,
    "end": 73.468,
    "zh": "我没多少。",
    "zh_hant": "我沒多少。"
  },
  {
    "index": 23,
    "text": "Well, I haven't got much either!",
    "start": 73.689,
    "end": 76.31,
    "zh": "好吧，我也没多少！",
    "zh_hant": "好吧，我也沒多少！"
  }
]
